# Dantooine again, the rebuilt Enclave and the Jedi Masters (TSL, 003EBO,
# 601DAN, 605DAN, 650DAN, 006EBO, 262TEL): Kreia aboard calls the Exile to
# the Enclave ("there is something there that you must hear"), the galaxy
# map to Dantooine, ashore with Kreia and Visas Marr, across the Khoonda
# Plains into the Enclave Courtyard and the rebuilt Jedi Enclave; Kreia
# rests in the courtyard and the party is sent off (a_650removeparty), the
# Exile alone before Vrook, Zez-Kai Ell and Kavar (no alignment in their
# talk), the Masters' judgement and Kreia's answer; out of the Enclave to
# the Ebon Hawk (k_006ebo): Atton on the Handmaiden taking Kreia to Atris,
# Telos next, Visas Marr's talk (male Exile), and TelMov15 to Atris's
# academy.
# Starts from the Ebon Hawk after Onderon:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @onderon_won data/routes/tsl/finale_enclave.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Dantooine Again"; GameBanshee 53
# (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Left: anything owed elsewhere first (DSimpson: Geeda's routes, HK-47's
# pacifist package; the chain has neither), the Enclave's corpses and
# locked footlocker.
#
# ASSUMES:
# - All four Masters found and alive (Vrook, Zez-Kai Ell, Vash dead on
#   Korriban, Kavar), so 000_Jedi_Found is 4: k_enter_605 plays the rebuilt
#   Enclave's room animations and sets 650DAN_Rebuilt, and 650jedi's start 6
#   (the Masters alive) plays, not the dark side's starts 1 to 5.
# - Kreia's call (kreia start 7, "We must go to Dantooine, to the Enclave")
#   answers a use aboard.
# - The Hawk lands at 601DAN as before (dantooine_khoonda), the ramp's party
#   screen taking Kreia and Visas. 605DAN's To_650 is open once the Enclave
#   is rebuilt (605DAN_Enclave_Open); no landing scene on Dantooine.
# - 650DAN: KreiaArriveParty (with Kreia along) plays 650kreia start 0 (she
#   sits; "Very well. I shall return shortly." answers her, the Awareness
#   reply needs the skill); the walk to the Masters is scripted
#   (a_move_pc_tag2/3, a_jediarrive); KreiaArrive is on the way.
#   The Council (650jedi start 6), Kreia's judgment and the Handmaiden
#   taking her (krehand1) follow on one another: one `talk`.
# - Trans006EBO's heartbeat (k_006ebo) moves the party to 006EBO once
#   650DAN_006EBO_Trans is set.
# - 006EBO (male): attonend, then a_load006end has Visas Marr start
#   visasend (WP_650END_PC_0); visasend's a_load262 plays TelMov15 and
#   starts 262TEL at FROM_006EBO.
use kreia            # "We must go to Dantooine, to the Enclave" (start 7)
use Galaxymap
travel 0             # Dantooine (planetary.2da)
party 6,9            # Kreia and Visas Marr
to tr_leave          # the ramp: the party screen
module 601dan
exit To_605@1        # the courtyard's east way
module 605dan
exit To_650          # the rebuilt Jedi Enclave
module 650dan
say Very well. I shall return shortly. # Kreia rests (650kreia start 0)
to KreiaArriveParty
talk
to KreiaArrive       # the Council chamber's approach
talk                 # Vrook, Zez-Kai Ell and Kavar (650jedi start 6), Kreia's answer
                     # to the Council and the Handmaiden taking her (krehand1); the
                     # Exile wakes with Force Enlightenment
to Trans006EBO       # out of the Enclave: aboard (k_006ebo)
module 006ebo
say Then we're going to Telos. We have no choice. # attonend
talk
talk                 # Visas Marr (visasend): a_load262
module 262tel        # TelMov15, FROM_006EBO
save telos_atris_again
